WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Your torn meniscus may not need an operating theatre. What does the medical literature say?

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:07.440
2013. Real surgery or sham surgery: same result.

3
00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:10.920
2016. Twelve weeks of exercise matched surgery.

4
00:00:10.920 --> 00:00:14.760
2022. Five years later, physiotherapy was no worse.

5
00:00:14.760 --> 00:00:19.800
2025. Ten years, no differences. Surgery does not beat exercise.

6
00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:23.200
If it locks, catches, swells or hurts, that is a different story.

7
00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:26.920
Examination and imaging. Send this to someone with a torn meniscus.

8
00:00:26.920 --> 00:00:29.880
What were you told: to have surgery or to exercise?

9
00:00:29.880 --> 00:00:32.400
Tomorrow: where your knee hurts.

